> What this experiment establishes

The report demonstrates a detached-target learned feature residual, explicit Gaussian codes,
a shared generator/discriminator and three correctly isolated, recomputed optimizer phases.
It preserves all source parameter/noise/forward archives, complete batch order and history.
An optional independent NumPy development check verifies every initial and recomputed group
derivative, all three exact first Adam steps, all nineteen forward fields, explicit noise,
every eligible validation candidate and prior decoding. It never fits or prepares data:

```
python3 scripts/check_vae_gan.py docs/mepml/examples/nn/2_autoencoders/2.2_variational_autoencoders/build/vae_gan
```

The observed run establishes implementation and update-order fidelity. It does not establish
perceptual similarity, realistic generation, disentanglement or improved image quality.
